/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// A program does not end until its actors have handled every message they accepted (structured ownership, spec VI).
act noisy(state, msg)
    say("handled " + :str(msg))
    return state
xx
q | :actor(0, noisy)
:post(q, 1)
:post(q, 2)
:post(q, 3)
